      "title": "ITI Limited Announces Appointment of C V Ramana Babu to Chief Financial Officer, Effective May 28, 2026",
      "body": "ITI Limited had appointed Shri Ramana Babu C V (Director Marketing with Additional Charge Director Finance) as the Chief Financial Officer, with effect from May 28, 2026. Shri C V Ramana Babu belongs to Indian Telecom Services (ITS) - 90 Batch. He is a graduate in Electronics & Communications from Andhra University and has a Diploma in Public policy and Sustainable Development from The Energy and Resource Institute (TERI), New Delhi. He had more than 30 years of experience in Project planning, execution, installation and commissioning and operations of various telecom networks. During the initial years in his career, he had worked in Software centre of Department of Telecom (DOT), dealing with large capacity Digital Switching Equipment. He had overseen smooth Y2K transition by developing s",
